      "title": "Why",
      "items": [
        "After #76 the check passed in CI and failed on the maintainer's machine, on files inside a dot directory a local tool had left behind, which git ignores through .git/info/exclude",
        "Prettier does not read git's exclude file; rather than name each tool, its ignore list skips every dot directory and re-includes .github, whose workflows are worth checking"
